/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 40 0 R
/T (This document describes a proposed chemical process for recovering valuable metals from waste printed circuit boards \(PCBs\). The workflow is organised into four stages: mechanical pretreatment, selective pre-leaching of base metals, target-metal leaching, and recovery/purification. The intended outcome is to separate metal-bearing fractions and recover selected metals for potential reuse. Actual recovery, selectivity, purity, reagent consumption and environmental performance must be established through controlled testing.)
/E (This document describes a proposed chemical process for recovering valuable metals from waste printed circuit boards \(PCBs\). The workflow is organised into four stages: mechanical pretreatment, selective pre-leaching of base metals, target-metal leaching, and recovery/purification. The intended outcome is to separate metal-bearing fractions and recover selected metals for potential reuse. Actual recovery, selectivity, purity, reagent consumption and environmental performance must be established through controlled testing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
