/Title (This document describes a proposed chemical process for recovering valuable metals from waste printed circuit boards \(PCBs\). The workflow is organised into four stages: mechanical pretreatment, selective pre-leaching of base metals, target-metal leaching, and recovery/purification. The intended outcome is to separate metal-bearing fractions and recover selected metals for potential reuse. Actual recovery, selectivity, purity, reagent consumption and environmental performance must be established through controlled testing.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 198 0 R
/Next 304 0 R
>>
endobj
