/Title (This document presents a staged concept for recovering valuable metals from waste PCBs through mechanical preparation, leaching and selective recovery. Its effectiveness and any claim of novelty require evidence from reproducible experiments, balanced chemistry, analytical verification and a review of relevant prior art. No specific recovery percentage or high-purity outcome is asserted without supporting data.)
