485 0 obj
<<
/Title (Collected PCBs are inspected and unsuitable items are removed. The boards are then reduced to smaller fragments using mechanical size-reduction equipment. Further grinding produces a more uniform feed fraction. Smaller particle size can increase exposed surface area, although excessive grinding may increase dust generation and complicate downstream separation.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 444 0 R
>>
