/Title (The prepared feed is contacted with a selected leaching solution in a suitable reactor. Under validated conditions, some base metals may dissolve into the liquid phase while a portion of precious-metal-bearing material remains in the solid residue. The slurry is then separated into a metal-containing solution and a solid residue. Both streams require analysis before further processing.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 448 0 R
/Next 528 0 R
>>
