/Title (The residue from Stage 2 is treated using a leaching system selected for the target metals and the measured composition of the feed. The process may require oxidation and careful control of solution chemistry. After leaching, filtration separates the liquid containing dissolved metal species from insoluble solids. The clarified solution is analysed before recovery is selected.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 450 0 R
/Next 531 0 R
>>
