547 0 obj
<<
/Title (Selectivity depends on the PCB composition, reagent chemistry, concentration, temperature, contact time and particle size. It should not be assumed that copper, lead and tin will all dissolve while gold and silver remain completely undissolved. This behaviour must be confirmed experimentally using mass-balance and solution analysis.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 528 0 R
>>
endobj
